  "title": "docuctl 3.5.0 Release Announcement",
  "body": "docuctl 3.5.0 is now available with several updates. You can now build pages in parallel and configure the worker count using the `--jobs` flag. The tool also caches rendered code blocks in `.docuctl/cache`. Additionally, this release fixes an issue where the search index missed pages with titles containing a colon."
}

